## 12. A Simple Mental Model

```
Think of your cache like a whiteboard in a classroom:

🕐 TTL Only        = "Erase everything every hour"
✍️  TTL + Delete   = "Erase specific notes when the teacher updates them, 
                     plus a full erase every hour just in case"
📢 Pub/Sub         = "The teacher shouts 'erase page 5!' and everyone does it"
📖 Redis Streams   = "The teacher writes it in a logbook; students check 
                     the logbook when they arrive"
🏷️  Tag-Based     = "Erase everything related to 'Math Chapter 3' at once"
```

